WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:26.980
<b>Resurrection of Ideon</b>

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.180
Are you sure you're not mistaken, Bes?

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.730
Since you're an air force officer,
 I trusted you enough to deploy 5 tanks.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.440
Just believe my eyes.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.360
Ugh! These leeches are everywhere!

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:26.290
My speed isn't rising. I won't be
able to catch up with Bes's tank.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.540
Oh? I'm overloaded?

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.000
What the?!

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.340
Deck! I told you not to come with me!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:48.640
Both Bes and Cosmo were in a hurry. 
Something fishy must be going on.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.110
Thank you for your efforts.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:05.240
Welcome to Planet Solo, point A-7
 of the Andromeda Galaxy.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.370
This is New Lopia Airport.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.620
You have arrived
at the landing site.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.710
Be careful. You may use auto-landing.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.170
The 300 families from the third
 immigration ship are finally here.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.050
I heard there are more women
than men. Sounds good.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.300
Yeah. Now New Lopia is starting
 to resemble a real town.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:29.140
Just when the immigration ship's here for the first time in six months. What is Bes planning to do?

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.150
No more!

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:45.200
Are we really going to be seizing something
from the science department?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:58.670
Stop! This is a military investigation!
Let us search the excavation site!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.320
Hurry and retrieve the probe!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.700
Hatch number 23!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.120
Hurry and retrieve the probe!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.540
Play the recording! Examine it immediately!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.580
Investigator #2, perform a computer analysis!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.460
Roger.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.290
Magnify slightly further!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.380
We need to understand what kind of species they are...

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.050
Are they intelligent beings?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.170
Oh, Gije, take a look at this!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.340
A city?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.080
Yes.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:51.350
This isn't one of our Buff Clan
 colony planets, right?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.140
Yes. We are certain of it.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.310
So you're saying they're aliens?

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.100
The probability is more than 99%.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.520
These look like buildings.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.480
Hmm? Something's moving!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.400
Examine it!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.530
They haven't detected us yet, have they?

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.700
There hasn't been any reaction.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.490
Raise our counter surveillance to level alpha!

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:10.990
Roger.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.790
The length of that moving object is 4 serks.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.370
It looks like one of our ordinary passenger vehicles.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.170
Well, this is just terrible.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.250
The fact that you've been assigned
 to research these aliens?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.050
Yeah.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:27.510
If those aliens are as 
technologically advanced as we are,

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:32.260
their presence might prevent us
from researching the Ide.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:36.890
No way. That building looks like
it came from our medieval times.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.650
What is it!?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.690
It's from the third deck! Lady Karala
has set off in Copola Unit 11!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.400
What?

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.110
Not again.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.870
Lady Karala! Where are you headed?

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.540
There is but one town in Logo Dau.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.790
These aliens don't appear to be that significant.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.550
We can't be sure until we finish our investigation.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.760
I am the commander of this investigation group.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.720
I am going to conduct an investigation on my own.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.800
Lady Karala!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.470
Cut him off.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.090
Yes.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.930
She's such a stubborn girl.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.560
Damido...

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.890
I'll launch Copolas 6 and 7.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.400
Thanks.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.820
What are you going to do if those aliens
 have invented something like a radar?

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.950
They couldn't have.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.540
My lady, it seems the Gram Zan
has sent pursuers after us.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.790
That Gije, he worries too much.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.250
Shiraku, can you shake them off?

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.760
Yes, ma'am. Please stay seated.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.720
Go ahead.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.250
Yes.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:59.160
Huh? That's Kasha.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.020
Enough already!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.200
It's her fault for traveling by bike.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.570
Kasha! Want me to take those leeches off your butt?

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.460
Good for you, Kasha!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.720
Looks like they've finally noticed.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.310
Yeah. And we were just an eyeblink away, too.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:45.770
On behalf of the court martial,
 you people now are under arrest.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.320
This excavation is under the jurisdiction
 of the science department!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.200
The military has no right to get involved!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.030
Stop joking around!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.370
Our investigation isn't finished yet!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:02.040
You don't know the situation,
so you shouldn't get involved!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.040
Immigration Law Number 17.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:08.130
All weapons and armed vehicles are
to be turned over to the military.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:11.260
The penalty for violating the law is
 two years of forced labor.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.550
We aren't certain what it is yet!

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:17.470
We just finished reconstructing it, so we couldn't possibly have made a report yet.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:22.310
So you built a giant vehicle just for fun? This thing?

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.650
This is...

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.820
Well, Gantz, wasn't it appropriate
 to send out the tanks?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.110
Yeah, you're right.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.870
You made this without permission.
The army is seizing it.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.330
We didn't build it. We restored it.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:45.330
You brought it from Earth and assembled it here?

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:46.790
That's impossible.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.880
You don't believe me, do you?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:52.510
These are relics excavated here at planet Solo.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:56.800
Relics? You're saying that this was
 left behind by ancient aliens from Solo?

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.470
That thing?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:17.070
However, Bes... What Sheryl just said was true.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.070
But...

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.160
You bitch!

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.500
This isn't a laughing matter, we've been
investigating it for half a year!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.710
But intelligent lifeforms do not exist on Solo.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.510
Colonization begun barely two years ago!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.430
Those things can't be ancient relics!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.010
Shut up!

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.510
This is my father's workplace!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:42.970
Cosmo!

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.270
Don't interfere in adult conversation.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.480
Do you think Bes is behaving like an adult?!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:49.900
Cosmo!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.770
Cosmo is just telling the truth.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.440
You bitch!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.700
My name is Sheryl Formossa, not "you bitch."

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.410
There's no doubt about it.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.540
They're very faint, but I'm detecting radio waves.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.370
Aliens...

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.460
And their civilization can utilize
 radio waves...

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.840
How far do you think they are in terms of science?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.170
I'm not sure.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:20.840
If they are culturally advanced,
this planet should be more developed.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.310
Well then, let's go and see.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.530
My lady. I stress, please take caution.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.290
If everything goes well, I'll
 promote you to the rank of Sabia.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.200
My lady!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.440
It's the aliens...

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.480
Is something the matter, my lady?

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:15.820
Eh?

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.400
We've discovered them at last.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:21.740
Let's go.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.320
My lady...

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.950
Damn that Shiraku.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:31.710
She's flying as good as usual. We've fallen behind.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.120
Isn't that a radar?

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.920
What? Does it belong to the aliens?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.170
Most likely...

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:38.880
Is that it?

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.630
Let's fall back!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.840
B-but, what about Lady Karala?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.220
Yes, you're right.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.190
Huh, is that an immigrant's airplane?

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.420
A flying saucer?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:16.500
It's an enemy attack!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.960
Start a counteroffensive!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:18.880
Enemy?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:19.800
What enemy?

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:20.880
Is that it?

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.810
Those fools! We don't even know
 how powerful the aliens are yet!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.020
Don't forget to record this!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:33.560
Yes.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.100
That looks like a tank.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.230
The aliens are just as scientifically
 advanced as we are.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.440
Why did you shoot?

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.400
Lady Karala landed somewhere around there!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.110
We can't let anything happen to Lady Karala!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.780
If she's harmed we could be reduced to slaves,

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.870
or even worse, they might blow us up!

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.870
You should know I had no choice!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.750
Two crafts are being chased?
Did they start a battle with the aliens?

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.760
A beam cannon!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.350
What kind of beings are they?!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.220
What should we do?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:11.810
We have no choice but to fight!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.480
We can't let them invade our planet!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.640
Behind us!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.230
Ah, the commander...

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.650
Run away from here!

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.740
To where?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:24.900
It doesn't matter!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.150
Hey!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.450
Deck, get up.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.160
Hide in the jungle!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.330
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.290
And abandon these relics?

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.710
You're on your own then!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.050
How's Lady Karala?!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.130
You!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:53.810
Get down!

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.190
What are you standing around for? Run away!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.150
You're a girl alright!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.360
Cosmo...

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.740
Deck! Head to the building on your left!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.620
What is this?

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.620
What was that tremor?!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.540
Dr. Formossa!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.170
Are these machines also relics?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.050
Yeah...

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.430
What's going on here?

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.380
I don't know.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.140
Those flying saucers just suddenly...

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.490
Deck! Don't go! You'll die too!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:50.240
Wait!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.900
Where are Lady Karala and Mayaya's Gadakkas?

00:14:58.450 --> 00:14:59.910
They're in front!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.510
Shi...Shiraku's Unit 11 has been shot down!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.890
Hey, the enemy's numbers are small!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.140
Send out the Gadakkas!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:15.560
Let's go!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:15.890
All right!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.290
Mayaya, did you see that?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.290
That alien man!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.040
Yes.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.960
The man who defeated the Gadakka, right?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:47.750
A man... That is a man, right?
That appearance...

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.090
Get away from that tank! It's dangerous!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.470
You bastard!

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.890
Don't hesitate!

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.640
Fight back with everything you've got!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:04.600
That man...

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.730
Mayaya, do you have a translator?

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:08.650
Yes.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.240
This is a new model from planet Guzurau.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.570
I just hope it works.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.910
Behind you! Behind you!

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.330
Behind...

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.660
Die!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:25.460
You idiot!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.540
You... idiot...

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.840
This should move with the sub-control system,
 but nothing is happening...

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:35.640
Why?

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.100
Are these the relics my father talked about?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:46.100
What are these relics?

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.770
Like I'd know!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.940
He told me not to come see him,

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.570
and said he was just researching fossils...

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.700
That gauge turned on?!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.580
This is the sign of Ideon...

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.710
Only one of those two legged things left!

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:15.590
It moved?!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.800
It started moving!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.640
Can we use this?

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:22.890
Incoming!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.230
We can flee to New Lopia with this!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:30.610
We installed this panel and control system 
on our own, so they aren't ready yet...

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:31.520
As long as it can move!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.280
They're coming!

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.110
Cosmo!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.110
Damn!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:38.780
Go!!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.540
It's moving?!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.460
With a tank like this, we'll be there right away!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.630
It can't be...

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.840
We've been studying these machines
from the Sixth Civilization...

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:00.220
for 6 months, and they never moved no matter what!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:01.640
It's moving now, isn't it!

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:06.020
That giant machine started to move!
 What should we do?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.310
Let's return straight to our main forces!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.650
I don't want that greenhorn Gije
 to make a fool out of me!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.530
This machine's durable!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:19.910
What's that?

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:22.830
It's coming!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.710
Cosmo!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.590
Shut up! Keep quiet!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:44.350
Why haven't our missiles caused any damage?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.180
I don't believe it...

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:51.100
After taking all those hits, it's still undamaged.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.820
This is one incredible machine, isn't it?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.620
What the? What's going on?

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.810
It stopped!

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:36.190
For what reason?

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.910
Come on, move!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:44.070
What's happening?

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:44.990
Beats me.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.910
Hey, look at the monitor to your left.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.370
A human shape?

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.830
Is it related to this mechanism?

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.960
That's it!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.880
This is what the "Giant" was about!

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.510
Is that the enemy's weapon?

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:05.550
It isn't the Legendary Giant, is it?

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:06.930
Don't be stupid!

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.350
It seems like those vehicles have
combined with each other.

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.020
Yes...

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:17.610
Have we no missiles left?

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.650
We still have some power.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:23.240
Let's do it! We can't let that giant attack the Buff Clan!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.950
They won't break our hard-earned peace!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.830
Cosmo!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:31.790
Shut up!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.620
It's connected, but not moving.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:45.590
The arm-like part is moving!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:47.180
Let's swing it!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.690
Gaseba's Copola!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.690
Yes!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.150
Alright, let's make this robot stand up and fight!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:14.910
A giant?

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.460
The Giant of Ide?

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:17.670
No way...

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.790
It's only an alien robot.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.460
Looks like it's standing up!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.970
Punch! We'll crush them with a punch!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.050
Damn aliens!

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:54.160
Such a thing...

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:56.960
Such a thing...

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:00.830
can't possibly be the Giant from the Legend of Ide!

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:07.050
I defeated them, but...

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:10.050
Just what is this machine?

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.550
This robot?

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.930
It stood up...

00:22:16.930 --> 00:22:19.690
I-Ideon...

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:26.070
What have we done?!

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:31.120
However...

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:32.910
That is...

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:34.240
...a Giant!

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:53.640
<i>A Buff Clan attack squadron
appears again on planet Solo.</i>

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:58.230
<i>As people begin to flee in confusion,
 the skies of New Lopia are stained a deep red.</i>

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.310
<i>Even though the young boys don't know the
giant robot Ideon's true power,</i>

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:05.650
<i>they boldly stand against the aliens.</i>

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:10.860
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant
Ideon: "New Lopia In Flames."</i>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:17.330
<b>New Lopia In Flames</b>

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:35.350
tatta hitotsu no hoshi ni suterare

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:35.350
<i>I've been abandoned merely by one world</i>

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:42.690
owarinai tabi kimi to ayumu to

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:42.690
<i>As I walk this endless journey together with you</i>

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:48.230
itsukushimi futo wakeatte

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:48.230
<i>We unexpectedly share our affection</i>

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:55.620
kizu wo nameau douke shibai

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:55.620
<i>Feeling sympathy for each other in this farcical play</i>

00:23:55.950 --> 00:24:01.710
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:23:55.950 --> 00:24:01.710
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:08.300
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:08.300
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

